# dependencies
node_modules/

# local deployment tooling + scratch, kept local and not published:
# mount.mjs / precheck.mjs are machine-specific, expected-package.json
# contains absolute local paths
#
# ...but the six native-toast scripts ARE source, not machine state: the manual page
# (docs/native-toast-人工验收.md) drives them step by step, and the 2026-10-01 incident
# showed what "kept local" costs — `tools/` was never committed and is gone. So this one
# subdirectory is published while the machine-specific helpers stay out.
deploy/*
!deploy/native-toast/

# verification artifacts: raw console/test dumps are not source
verify-independent/_raw/
verify/_raw/

# misc
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
